{
  "info": {
    "name": "TecnoCore Guatemala - API Tarea 5 (JWT)",
    "description": "Colección de pruebas para la API REST (Express + MongoDB Atlas) de TecnoCore Guatemala, con autenticación stateless por JSON Web Token (expiración de 5 minutos). Importar en Postman o Thunder Client. Configura {{baseUrl}} apuntando a http://localhost:4000/api en desarrollo o a la URL pública en producción.\n\nFlujo recomendado:\n1. Ejecutar 'Auth > Login correcto'. El test script guarda el token recibido en la variable de colección {{token}}.\n2. Ejecutar 'Recursos (Productos) > Protegidos > Crear producto - token válido (201)'. Usa automáticamente {{token}} en el header Authorization.\n3. Para la evidencia de expiración: ejecutar el login, anotar la hora, esperar más de 5 minutos (política JWT_EXPIRES_IN=5m) y volver a ejecutar 'Crear producto - token expirado (401)' con el mismo {{token}} ya capturado. La API responde 401 con { \"error\": \"token_expired\", ... }.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:4000/api" },
    { "key": "productoId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Registrar usuario",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Ana Pérez\",\n  \"correo\": \"ana.perez@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Secreta123\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Registrar usuario - correo duplicado (409)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Ana Pérez\",\n  \"correo\": \"ana.perez@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Secreta123\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login correcto",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Responde 200 con token', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  pm.expect(data.token).to.be.a('string');",
                  "});",
                  "if (data.token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', data.token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"correo\": \"ana.perez@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Secreta123\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login credenciales inválidas (401)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"correo\": \"ana.perez@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"incorrecta\"\n}"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Recursos (Productos)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Lectura pública",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Listar todos los productos",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/recursos"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Filtrar por categoría",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/recursos?categoria=laptops"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Buscar por texto (q)",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/recursos?q=ryzen"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Filtrar destacados",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/recursos?featured=true"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Obtener producto por id",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/recursos/{{productoId}}"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Obtener producto inexistente (404)",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/recursos/000000000000000000000000"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Protegidos (requieren Authorization: Bearer <token>)",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Crear producto - sin token (401 unauthorized)",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/recursos",
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"TC-900\",\n  \"name\": \"Webcam Full HD\",\n  \"category\": \"perifericos\",\n  \"price\": 295\n}"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Crear producto - token válido (201)",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "pm.test('Responde 201 con el producto creado', function () {",
                      "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                      "});",
                      "const data = pm.response.json();",
                      "if (data && data.id) {",
                      "  pm.collectionVariables.set('productoId', data.id);",
                      "}"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
                ],
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/recursos",
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"TC-900\",\n  \"name\": \"Webcam Full HD\",\n  \"specs\": \"1080p · micrófono integrado\",\n  \"category\": \"perifericos\",\n  \"availability\": \"En existencia\",\n  \"price\": 295,\n  \"featured\": false,\n  \"description\": \"Webcam para videollamadas con enfoque automático.\",\n  \"delivery\": \"Entrega estimada de 2 a 4 días hábiles.\",\n  \"specTable\": [\n    { \"label\": \"Resolución\", \"value\": \"1920x1080\" },\n    { \"label\": \"Conexión\", \"value\": \"USB\" }\n  ],\n  \"thumbnail\": \"\"\n}"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Crear producto - token expirado (401 token_expired)",
              "description": "Ejecutar este request reutilizando el {{token}} capturado en 'Login correcto', pero esperando más de 5 minutos después del login (JWT_EXPIRES_IN=5m). Debe responder 401 con { \"error\": \"token_expired\", \"message\": \"La sesión ha expirado o ya no es válida. Por favor, inicie sesión nuevamente.\" }.",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "const data = pm.response.json();",
                      "pm.test('Responde 401 token_expired', function () {",
                      "  pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                      "  pm.expect(data.error).to.eql('token_expired');",
                      "});"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
                ],
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/recursos",
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"TC-901\",\n  \"name\": \"Micrófono USB\",\n  \"category\": \"perifericos\",\n  \"price\": 199\n}"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Actualizar producto (PUT) - token válido",
              "request": {
                "method": "PUT",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
                ],
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/recursos/{{productoId}}",
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"price\": 3295,\n  \"availability\": \"Últimas unidades\"\n}"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Eliminar producto - token válido",
              "request": {
                "method": "DELETE",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/recursos/{{productoId}}"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
